"shared[`quarkus.amqp.devservices.shared`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.amqp.devservices.shared+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Indicates if the AMQP broker managed by Quarkus Dev Services is shared. When "
